Package: renviron
Title: Environment File Management for R Projects
Version: 0.6.0
Authors@R:
    c(person("Daniel E.", "de la Rosa", , "me@dnldelarosa.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
             comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5965-5277")),
      person(given = "Adatar", role = "cph"))
Description: Read environment files without modifying the current session,
    load selected variables, and edit individual assignments while preserving
    unrelated lines. Uses the native R environment reader in an isolated
    process and writes literal values with validation and file replacement.
